me>Baker</surname><given-names>TA</given-names></name></person-group><source>DNA Replication</source><year>1991</year><publisher-name>W.H. Freeman and Company</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Blanco</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Bernad</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Lazaro</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Garmendia</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Salas</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Highly efficient DNA synthesis by the phage phi 29 DNA polymerase. Symmetrical mode of DNA replication</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>1989</year><volume>264</volume><fpage>8935</fpage><lpage>8940</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2498321</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lizardi</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhu</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Bray-Ward</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Ward</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mutation detection and single-molecule counting using isothermal rolling-circle amplification</article-title><source>Nat Genet</source><year>1998</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>225</fpage><lpage>232</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9662393</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/898</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hawkins</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name><name><surname>Detter</